    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "Indeed I think it's useless, the call below (`setState`) trigger the `change` event which already contains `onChange`. You may have noticed that we compute two times the `uiState` on remove. Once before `setState` to be able to correctly get the `SearchParameters`, once after when the event is emitted (regular flow). We might be able to avoid the two consecutive calls but at the moment it's good enough.",
